  "provenance": {
    "source": "human",
    "note": "Written against the OALD10 dialect survey in /tmp/odc-oald10-full/REPORT.md; every surviving source class is either mapped to an odc slot, cleared by the inline-decoration whitelist, or declared odc-unmapped. Validated on 500 stratified and 51,310 full body records."
